<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28493" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mēlĭnus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήλινος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to quinces,
				quince-; quinceyellow;</i> only as <i>subst.</i>:
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mēlĭnum</span></b> , i,
			n.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> (Sc. oleum.) <i>Quince-oil</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 13, 1,
				2, § 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">23, 6, 54, §
			103</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			(Sc. unguentum.) <i>Quince-ointment</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 13, 1,
				2, § 5</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>An eye-salve</i>, Inscr. Tochōn, Cachets
			des Ocul. p. 61.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b> (Sc. vestimentum.) <i>A quince-yellow
				garment</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ep. 2, 2, 49</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
</div>